---
import BaseLayout from "../layout/BaseLayout.astro"
import potjie1 from "../images/potjie1.webp"
import mejLutzville from "../images/mejlutzville1.webp"
import tugofwar from "../images/tugofwar.webp"
import ImageCarousel from '../component/Carousel.jsx'
import PERDE from '../component/PERDE.js'
import VOERTUIE from '../component/VOERTUIE.js'
import DarkCarousel from '../component/DarkCarousel.jsx'
import Golfday from '../images/Golfday.webp'
---
<BaseLayout title="Aktiwiteite" description="By die 2024 Lutzville Landbouskou sal daar aktiwiteite wees iedere en elke persoon.">
    <section id="BannerText" class="pt-32">
        <div class="lg:w-1/2 w-full mx-auto py-5 px-5 lg:px-0">
            <p class="text-xl text-center">
                Vermaak vir jonk en oud - dit beloof die skou in 2024.  Daar is prag perde en uitmuntende skape wat ten toon gestel word op vanjaar se skou.  
                Stalletjies wat ieder en elk se oog sal vang, sowel as kinder vermaak areas.  Daar is 'n Petting Zoo vir die kinders, 'n Potjiekos kompetisie vir die wat kan, 
                'n Gholf dag vir die mans, 'n vroue oggend vir die dames, by Lutzville Landbouskou 2024 is daar iets vir elk.  Kom geniet dit saam met ons!  
            </p>
            <div class="my-5 text-center">
                <h3 class="text-xl mb-8">Vir meer informasie sien ons dag program sodat jy niks mis nie</h3>
                <a href="/Dagprogram.pdf" class="text-2xl hover:text-gray-50 hover:bg-gray-900 p-5 rounded-full border-gray-900 border-2">Dag Program</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
    <section id="Potjiekos Kompetisie">
        <div class="lg:px-[20%] md:px-[5%] px-5 py-20 flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-y-5 md:gap-y-0 md:gap-x-5 bg-gray-900">
            <div class="md:w-2/3 md:text-end place-content-center md:border-r-2 md:pr-5 border-gray-50 text-gray-50">
                <h3 class="uppercase text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl">kom neem deel aan die potjiekos en braaikompetisie</h3>
                <a href="/PotjiekosInskrywingsVorm.pdf" class="text-2xl md:text-3xl text-yellow-300 hover:underline">Skryf in!</a>
            </div>
            <div class="md:w-1/3 place-content-center">
                <a href="/PotjiekosInskrywingsVorm.pdf">
                    <img src={potjie1.src} alt="A Potjie on a fire" class="w-full">
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
    <section id="MejLutzville">
        <div class="lg:px-[20%] md:px-[5%] px-5 py-20 flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-y-5 md:gap-y-0 md:gap-x-5">
            <div class="md:w-1/2 p-5 border-b-2 border-r-2 border-gray-900 h-fit">
                    <img src={mejLutzville.src} alt="The three contestants at a beauty pagent" class="w-full rounded-tr-3xl rounded-bl-3xl">
            </div>
            <div class="md:w-1/2 md:text-start place-content-center md:border-r-2 md:pr-5 border-gray-50">
                <h3 class="uppercase text-4xl md:text-6xl">Mej Lutzville</h3>
                <h3 class="uppercase text-2xl md:text-4xl">Geniet die Glans</h3>
                <p class="md:text-xl text-lg">
                    Kom ondersteun of kom neem deel.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
    <section id="Perde" class="lg:px-[20%] md:px-[5%] px-5 bg-gray-900 text-gray-50 py-16">
        <div class="py-5 md:w-2/3 w-full mx-auto">
            <h3 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl text-center">Perde Skou</h3>
            <p class="text-lg py-5 text-center">Daar is prag perde op skou.  Koetse van sprokiesverhale.  Benede-Olifantsrivier Vierperde Kampioenskap and Karperde Kampioenskap is ook daar om te geniet!</p>
            <div class="flex justify-center">
                <a href="/PerdeInskrywings.pdf" class="text-2xl p-3 inline-block bg-gray-50 rounded-full text-gray-900 w-fit hover:text-gray-50 hover:bg-gray-900 hover:border-gray-50 border-2">Perde Inskrywingsvorm</a>
            </div>
        </div>
        <ImageCarousel items={PERDE} client:only/>
    </section>
    <section id="VeteranVoertuie" class="xl:px-[20%] lg:px-[10%] md:px-[5%] px-5 py-10 bg-gray-50">
        <div class="flex gap-5 flex-col md:flex-row">
            <div class="md:w-1/2 w-full place-content-center text-center">
                <h3 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl uppercase">Veteraan Karre en Trekkers</h3>
                <br>
                <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl">Vir die met 'n nostalgiese oog</p>
            </div>
            <div class="md:w-1/2 w-full">
                <DarkCarousel items={VOERTUIE} client:only/>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
    <section id="Toutrek">
        <div class="lg:px-[20%] md:px-[5%] px-5 py-20 flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-y-5 md:gap-y-0 md:gap-x-5">
            <div class="md:w-1/2 p-5 border-b-2 border-r-2 border-gray-900 h-fit">
                    <img src={tugofwar.src} alt="Tugofwar" class="w-full rounded-tr-3xl rounded-bl-3xl">
            </div>
            <div class="md:w-1/2 md:text-start place-content-center md:border-r-2 md:pr-5 border-gray-50">
                <h3 class="uppercase text-4xl md:text-6xl">Toutrek Kompetisie</h3>
                <h3 class="uppercase text-2xl md:text-4xl">31 Julie</h3>
                <p class="md:text-xl text-lg">
                    Inskrywings gelde - R400 per span <br>
                    Inskrywings sluit 15 Julie <br> 
                    Kontak Jaco vir meer inligting by 078 611 1643
                </p>
                <a href="/ToutrekInskrywingsvorm.jpg" class="text-2xl md:text-3xl hover:underline">Skryf in!</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
        <section id="Gholfdag">
        <div class="lg:px-[20%] md:px-[5%] px-5 py-20 flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-y-5 md:gap-y-0 md:gap-x-10 bg-gray-900">
            <div class="md:w-1/2 md:text-center place-content-center md:border-r-2 md:pr-5 border-gray-50 text-gray-50">
                <h3 class="uppercase text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl">Gholfdag</h3>
                <p class="md:text-xl text-lg">
                    <br>Saterdag - 3 Augustus<br> 
                    Inskrywings gelde - R200 per persoon<br>
                </p>
                <a href="/GholfdagLutzville.webp" class="text-2xl md:text-3xl text-yellow-300 hover:underline">Meer Inligting</a>
            </div>
            <div class="md:w-1/2 place-content-center">
                <a href="/GholfdagLutzville.webp">
                    <img src={Golfday.src} alt="Golfball on a peg" class="w-full">
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</BaseLayout>